---
// Easter egg: se abre con el rombo verde del footer.
// <dialog> nativo aporta gratis el atrapado de foco, el fondo inerte y Esc.
---

<dialog
  id="game-dialog"
  aria-labelledby="game-title"
  class="m-auto w-[560px] max-w-[calc(100vw-2.5rem)] rounded-[3px] border border-ink/10 bg-ground p-7 text-ink shadow-[0_40px_80px_-30px_rgba(13,21,38,0.5)] backdrop:bg-night/55 backdrop:backdrop-blur-sm"
>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-ink/12 pb-3">
    <h2 id="game-title" class="u-label text-graphite">Packet Catch</h2>
    <button
      type="button"
      data-close-dialog
      aria-label="Cerrar minijuego"
      class="cursor-pointer font-mono text-lg leading-none text-graphite transition-colors hover:text-ink"
    >
      ×
    </button>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-4 mb-5 text-sm text-graphite">
    Mueve el router con el mouse o las flechas. Atrapa los paquetes buenos, esquiva los rojos.
  </p>

  <canvas
    id="game-canvas"
    width="504"
    height="340"
    class="block w-full cursor-none rounded-[3px] border border-ink/10 bg-panel"></canvas>

  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
    <p class="u-label text-graphite" aria-live="polite">
      Puntos <strong class="text-ink" data-game-score>0</strong> · Vidas
      <strong class="text-ink" data-game-lives>3</strong>
    </p>
    <button type="button" data-restart-game class="u-btn u-btn-solid !px-5 !py-2.5 !text-sm">
      Reiniciar
    </button>
  </div>
</dialog>
